CHAPTER
III OFFICERS OF THE UNIVERSITY
4. Officers of the University.‑‑The following shall be the
officers of the University;‑‑
(1) The Patron;
(2) the Chancellor;
(3) the Chairman;
(4) the President;
(5) the Deans;
(6) the Directors;
(7) the Chairmen of the
Teaching Departments;
(8) the Registrar;
(9) the Director of Finance;
(10) the Librarian;
(11) the Controller of
Examinations;
(12) the Resident Auditor; and
(13) such other persons as may
be prescribed to be officers of the University.

